# A trailing comma before `|`: DS0127 with a fix that removes it.
mode: syntax
---- query
'orders.csv' | project amount, customerId, | take 5
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..52
  PIPELINE@0..51
    LITERAL@0..12
      STRING@0..12 "'orders.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@12..13 " "
    PIPE@13..14 "|"
    WHITESPACE@14..15 " "
    PROJECT_OP@15..42
      IDENT@15..22 "project"
      WHITESPACE@22..23 " "
      NAMED_EXPR@23..29
        NAME_REF@23..29
          IDENT@23..29 "amount"
      COMMA@29..30 ","
      WHITESPACE@30..31 " "
      NAMED_EXPR@31..41
        NAME_REF@31..41
          IDENT@31..41 "customerId"
      COMMA@41..42 ","
    WHITESPACE@42..43 " "
    PIPE@43..44 "|"
    WHITESPACE@44..45 " "
    TAKE_OP@45..51
      IDENT@45..49 "take"
      WHITESPACE@49..50 " "
      LITERAL@50..51
        LONG@50..51 "5"
  WHITESPACE@51..52 "\n"

error[DS0127]: trailing `,` before `|`
  --> query:1:42
  |
1 | 'orders.csv' | project amount, customerId, | take 5
  |                                          ^ nothing follows this `,` in the list
  |
  = help: remove the `,`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    'orders.csv' | project amount, customerId | take 5
which parses without errors
